35
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:20,820
To understand why the cringe strikes

36
00:01:20,820 --> 00:01:22,440
at night, you first have to

37
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:23,980
look at what happens during the day.

38
00:01:24,860 --> 00:01:26,560
From the moment your alarm rings,

39
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,620
your brain is under an unrelenting

40
00:01:28,620 --> 00:01:30,400
