56
00:02:11,820 --> 00:02:14,940
First discovered by neuroscientists in 2001,

57
00:02:15,420 --> 00:02:18,040
the DMN is your brain's internal search engine.

58
00:02:18,580 --> 00:02:20,800
It is responsible for daydreaming,

59
00:02:21,220 --> 00:02:23,680
