and replaying past experiences.

61
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:28,720
But here is the critical problem.

62
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:30,840
Between 1 a.m.

63
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,140
and 4 a.m.,

64
00:02:32,140 --> 00:02:34,360
your brain experiences a phenomenon known

65
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:36,700
