66
00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:39,680
Your prefrontal cortex, the rational,

67
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:41,820
mature CEO of your mind that

68
00:02:41,820 --> 00:02:43,920
contextualizes events and tells you,

