74
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,860
The bouncer is asleep.

75
00:02:59,860 --> 00:03:02,280
And without executive logic there to

76
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:04,480
moderate the signal, a minor awkward

77
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:06,120
remark from half a decade ago

78
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:08,120
is processed not as ancient history,

79
