81
00:03:11,820 --> 00:03:13,260
But why does the brain choose

82
00:03:13,260 --> 00:03:14,980
embarrassing memories specifically?

83
00:03:16,020 --> 00:03:17,740
Why doesn't your default mode network

84
00:03:17,740 --> 00:03:19,180
wake you up at 2 a .m.

85
00:03:19,340 --> 00:03:20,600
to replay that time you gave

86
