a hypervigilant threat -caching machine.

112
00:04:24,100 --> 00:04:26,040
When you commit a social blunder,

113
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:28,460
you're subconscious flags that memory as

114
00:04:28,460 --> 00:04:30,500
