You don't remember their cringe because

154
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:07,280
you were far too busy obsessing

155
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:08,000
over your own.

156
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:10,160
Every single person you have ever

157
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:12,060
