169
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:42,140
When you forcefully order your brain

170
00:06:42,140 --> 00:06:43,480
at 2 a.m.,

171
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,640
stop thinking about this,

172
00:06:45,020 --> 00:06:46,660
go to sleep, your brain has

173
00:06:46,660 --> 00:06:48,280
