177
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:57,480
Step number two, close the file.

178
00:06:58,580 --> 00:07:00,020
Remember the zygonic effect,

179
00:07:00,540 --> 00:07:03,460
your subconscious loops memories because they feel unresolved.

180
